<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46497" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūgo</span></b> , xi, ctum, 3, v. a.
		root svag-; cf. sucus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to suck</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(animalium) alia sugunt, alia carpunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D. 2, 47, 122</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(agni) matris sugunt mammam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 1, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porca frequentiore numero sucta deficiet,</span>”
				<i>exhausted</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Febr. 26, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terram,</span>”
				<i>to exhaust</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 44, 3</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum lacte nutricis errorem suxisse,</span>”
				<i>to have sucked</i>, <i>imbibed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 3, 1, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
